  {
    "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CEA5KVFR000",
    "@type": "ArtifactNode",
    "title": "aperas-skill.md",
    "text": "None — v2 closed the four found by a user read of v1.4, v1.4 closed the nine found by the session that confirmed the skill can be loaded, consented to, and still not govern the work, and the v1 restructure's seven are resolved below them. Other gaps found while working the graph stay parked in [Freeflow](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CE8XWZK0001) until a dedicated home exists.",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4BR003",
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CEA5KW4G001"
    ],
